      "content": [
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "Testing this again after the Penn State Concentrate, and I'm seeing properties, but not the namespaces that it came with. I've attached two screenshots to make sure we're on the same page. If so, shall we close this ticket, and create a new one to register namespace prefixes?",
